# The two wire contracts a producer implements against, carried in the source
# archive so a release can be read without the git repository. Shipping one
# without the other would be worse than shipping neither: a reader could not
# tell whether the missing contract is unspecified or merely unshipped.
# The wheel stays code only — nothing here is installed into site-packages.
include schemas/teammem-bundle-v1.md
include docs/schemas/teammem-meeting-v1.md
